  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## Service change on 2026-09-14\n\n- Echo moved the separate rule feed used by Mock.Client and Mock.Server to the paid plans. This was a service change, not a package release: an already installed 0.2.3 mock package can stop obtaining rules on Free without its package changing.\n- Contract validation and the contract APIs remain available on Free. Creating an application, managing its contract bindings and issuing a new key require the paid Applications surface; an existing active contract key can continue to use an existing binding.\n\n## 0.2.3\n\n- Align the package version with the readable contract JSON release; contract validation behavior is unchanged.\n\n## 0.2.2\n\n- Align the package version with the hosted authoring validation release.\n- Correct the contract review destination printed in validation reports.\n- Correct public documentation and product links.\n- Include NuGet release notes and symbols in the coordinated Echo package release.\n\n## 0.1.0\n\n- Validate consumed contracts against committed snapshots, with explicit compatibility results and offline behavior.",
